Package: QuantWealthR
Title: Quantitative Wealth and Inequality Analysis for Archaeological Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Mikkel", "Nørtoft", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "mattbeets@gmail.com")
Description: Tools for calculating prestige values, wealth scores, and inequality
    measures from archaeological count data (e.g. grave goods, hoard types, house
    objects) and physical measures (e.g. house floor area). Implements Bayesian and
    mean-based prestige estimation, Gini coefficients with confidence intervals,
    Lorenz curves, decile distributions, category bias simulations, and a batch
    pipeline for multi-period datasets. Produces static ggplot2 visualisations.
